{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "74fef593-238a-8088-9c6c-26818fbed153",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T14:11:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dario Brito",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:10:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:10:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I'm trying to reach the school department. Is this the school department?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:10:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, sir, this is the City Clerk at City Hall. The school department is a separate office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:10:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Oh, I see. I'm sorry about that. I must have dialed it wrong. [pause] I was reading the number off a paper, one digit at a time, and I may have skipped one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:10:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's easy to do. Were you calling about school buses, or enrollment, or something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:10:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's about a bus stop, for my neighbor's grandchild. They want to know if the stop changed after, um, last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. Hold on, there's the refrigerator humming again, can you hear that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:10:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little, yes. It's not a problem. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:10:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It stops and starts. Anyway, that's all I need, just the right office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:10:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I'd suggest looking up the Newport school department's main office number, or checking their website. They can tell you about bus stops. I can't see their routes from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:11:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I'll do that. I'm sorry again for bothering you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:11:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bother at all, Mr. Brito. Take care now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:11:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
